  Find the existing import block (lines 7–14) in `src/lib/map/useFloorPlanLayer.ts`:
  ```ts
  import {
    SOURCE_ID,
    LAYER_IDS,
    FLAT_LAYER_SPECS,
    EXTRUSION_LAYER_SPECS,
    HIGHLIGHT_LAYER_SPECS,
    SELECTED_LAYER_SPECS,
  } from "./layer-definitions";
  ```

  Replace it with:
  ```ts
  import {
    SOURCE_ID,
    LAYER_IDS,
    FLAT_LAYER_SPECS,
    EXTRUSION_LAYER_SPECS,
    HIGHLIGHT_LAYER_SPECS,
    SELECTED_LAYER_SPECS,
    HOVER_FILL_COLOR_SUBTLE,
    HOVER_FILL_OPACITY_SUBTLE,
  } from "./layer-definitions";
  ```

- [ ] **Step 2: Export the `ViewMode` type**

  After the existing `export type FloorPlanRenderMode = "flat" | "3d";` line (line 16), add:
  ```ts
  export type ViewMode = "editor" | "preview" | "map";
  ```

- [ ] **Step 3: Add `viewMode` to `FloorPlanLayerOptions`**

  In the `FloorPlanLayerOptions` interface (starting at line 18), add `viewMode` after `hoveredFeatureId`:
  ```ts
  export interface FloorPlanLayerOptions {
    map: maplibregl.Map | null;
    canvasData: CanvasData | null;
    floorConfigs: FloorConfig[];
    location: { lat: number; lng: number } | null;
    activeLevelId: string | null;
    visible: boolean;
    mode: FloorPlanRenderMode;
