  applySelection(map, selectedIdsRef.current);
  applyHighlightPaint(map, viewModeRef.current);  // <-- add this line
  ```

  Also update the existing `applyHighlight` line in the same block (line 199) which currently reads:
  ```ts
  applyHighlight(map, hoveredFeatureRef.current);
  ```
  Change it to:
  ```ts
  applyHighlight(map, viewModeRef.current === "editor" ? null : hoveredFeatureRef.current);
  ```

- [ ] **Step 8: Call `applyHighlightPaint` in the mount/style-reload `setup` function**

  Inside the `setup` function in the mount `useEffect` (the one with `[map]` dependency), find the final two lines:
  ```ts
  applyHighlight(map, hoveredFeatureRef.current);
  applySelection(map, selectedIdsRef.current);
  ```
  Replace with:
  ```ts
  applyHighlight(map, viewModeRef.current === "editor" ? null : hoveredFeatureRef.current);
  applySelection(map, selectedIdsRef.current);
