## Task 6: Pattern for Future Public Map Viewer

The public-facing map viewer (`mode="map"`) does not exist yet in the codebase. When it is built, apply the following pattern:

```ts
// In the public map viewer component — exact same as PreviewOverlay changes:

useFloorPlanLayer({
  map, canvasData, floorConfigs, location: { lat, lng }, activeLevelId: activeId,
  visible: true, mode: "3d", viewMode: "map", visibleLevelIds, hoveredFeatureId: hovered,
});

useFloorPlanLabels({
  map, canvasData, location: { lat, lng }, floorConfigs,
  visibleLevelIds: visibleLevelIds ?? null, visible: true,
  viewMode: "map",
  buildingName: "<location name from your data source>",
  pinLabel,
});

// Name-gate in mousemove handler:
const onMove = (e: maplibregl.MapLayerMouseEvent) => {
  const props = e.features?.[0]?.properties;
  const hasName = props?.name && String(props.name).trim() !== "";
  setHovered(hasName ? String(props!.id) : null);
};
```

No commit needed for this task — it is documentation only.

